---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Christina Siciliani" description="How this website handles your data.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <h2>Data collected</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not collect personal data directly. If you contact Christina by email,
        your email address and message are stored in her email client for the purpose of replying.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate traffic. Google Analytics may set
        cookies and process anonymised usage data. You can opt out at any time using the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Booking</h2>
      <p>
        Discovery-call booking is handled by <a href="https://calendly.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Calendly</a>.
        When you book, Calendly collects the details you enter and processes them under their own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under Swiss data-protection law, you have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal
        data Christina holds about you. To request this, email
        <a href="mailto:gethealthy@christinasiciliani.com">gethealthy@christinasiciliani.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:gethealthy@christinasiciliani.com">gethealthy@christinasiciliani.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
